-# Model Files
+# TFLite Model Files
 
-Place the TFLite model binaries for the app in this folder:
+The placeholder files here must be replaced with real models for AI face recognition.
+Without real models, the app runs in **Demo Mode** (all features work, just with simulated matching).
 
-- blazeface.tflite
-- mobilefacenet_int8.tflite
-- blink_detector.tflite
+## Download Commands (run from this folder)
 
-These binaries are intentionally not committed to git.
+```bash
+# 1. BlazeFace — face detection (already correct in repo ✅)
+# blazeface.tflite is valid — do NOT re-download
+
+# 2. MobileFaceNet — face embeddings (~3.5MB)
+# Download from MediaPipe:
+curl -L "https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_embedder/face_embedder/float16/1/face_embedder.tflite" -o mobilefacenet_int8.tflite
+
+# 3. Blink detector — liveness detection (~500KB)
+curl -L "https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/iris_landmark/iris_landmark/float16/1/iris_landmark.tflite" -o blink_detector.tflite
+```
+
+## Verify your models are valid
+```bash
+python3 -c "
+for m in ['blazeface.tflite','mobilefacenet_int8.tflite','blink_detector.tflite']:
+    with open(m,'rb') as f: h=f.read(8)
+    print(m, '✅ VALID' if h[4:8]==b'TFL3' else '❌ INVALID - re-download')
+"
+```
+
+## Without real models
+The app shows ⚠️ Demo Mode banner. Camera shows live feed.
+Registration stores a random normalized embedding.
+Attendance does a demo match against registered names.
+Everything is fully functional for demonstration.
